msgstr "\\f[B]-tz\\f[R], \\f[B]--timezone\\f[R] \\f[I]NAME\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:120
msgid "Set the timezone.  Default: \\f[B]Etc/UTC\\f[R].\\fR"
msgstr "Setzt die Zeitzone. Standard: \\f[B]Etc/UTC\\f[R].\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: minios-cmd.1:120
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-ib\\f[R], \\f[B]--initramfs-builder\\f[R] \\f[I]NAME\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-ib\\f[R], \\f[B]--initramfs-builder\\f[R] \\f[I]NAME\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:124
msgid ""
"Select \\f[B]livekit\\f[R] or \\f[B]dracut\\f[R].  Default: "
"\\f[B]dracut\\f[R].\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Wählen Sie \\f[B]livekit\\f[R] oder \\f[B]dracut\\f[R]. Standard: "
"\\f[B]dracut\\f[R].\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: minios-cmd.1:124
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-mln\\f[R], \\f[B]--menu-language\\f[R] \\f[I]NAME\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-mln\\f[R], \\f[B]--menu-language\\f[R] \\f[I]NAME\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:128
msgid ""
"Select \\f[B]multilang\\f[R] or a supported menu locale.  Default: "
"\\f[B]multilang\\f[R].\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Wählen Sie \\f[B]multilang\\f[R] oder eine unterstützte Menü-Locale. "
"Standard: \\f[B]multilang\\f[R].\\fR"

#. type: SS
#: minios-cmd.1:128
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ubuntu Pro Option"
msgstr "Ubuntu Pro-Option"

#. type: TP
#: minios-cmd.1:129
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]--ubuntu-pro-token\\f[R] \\f[I]TOKEN\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]--ubuntu-pro-token\\f[R] \\f[I]TOKEN\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:138
msgid ""
"Attach an Ubuntu Pro subscription during a Bionic, Focal, Jammy, or Noble "
"build.  Other targets skip attachment with a warning.  The builder detaches "
"the subscription and removes the token from the final image.  Command-line "
"tokens may be visible in shell history or process listings."
msgstr ""
"Fügt während eines Bionic-, Focal-, Jammy- oder Noble-Builds ein Ubuntu Pro-"
"Abonnement hinzu. Für andere Ziele wird die Anbindung mit einer Warnung "
"übersprungen. Der Builder trennt das Abonnement und entfernt das Token aus "
"dem finalen Abbild. Kommandozeilen-Tokens können in der Shell-Historie oder "
"in Prozesslisten sichtbar sein."

#. type: SH
#: minios-cmd.1:138
#, no-wrap
msgid "DEFAULTS"
msgstr "STANDARDS"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:147
msgid ""
"The frontend defaults are \\f[B]COMP_TYPE=zstd\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]KERNEL_PROVIDER=distribution\\f[R], \\f[B]KERNEL_FLAVOUR=none\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]MINIOS_KERNEL_SERIES=auto\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]KERNEL_PAYLOAD_MODE=runtime\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]KERNEL_BUILD_DKMS=false\\f[R], \\f[B]LOCALE=en_US\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]MULTILINGUAL=false\\f[R], \\f[B]KEEP_LOCALES=false\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]LIVE_TIMEZONE=Etc/UTC\\f[R], \\f[B]INITRAMFS_BUILDER=dracut\\f[R], and "
"\\f[B]MENU_LANG=multilang\\f[R].\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Die Frontend-Standardeinstellungen sind \\f[B]COMP_TYPE=zstd\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]KERNEL_PROVIDER=distribution\\f[R], \\f[B]KERNEL_FLAVOUR=none\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]MINIOS_KERNEL_SERIES=auto\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]KERNEL_PAYLOAD_MODE=runtime\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]KERNEL_BUILD_DKMS=false\\f[R], \\f[B]LOCALE=en_US\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]MULTILINGUAL=false\\f[R], \\f[B]KEEP_LOCALES=false\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]LIVE_TIMEZONE=Etc/UTC\\f[R], \\f[B]INITRAMFS_BUILDER=dracut\\f[R] und "
"\\f[B]MENU_LANG=multilang\\f[R].\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:155
msgid ""
"Trixie-based \\f[B]i386\\f[R] and \\f[B]i386-pae\\f[R] values select the "
"MiniOS provider when the distribution and architecture are supplied to the "
"frontend through options or the environment.  Values present only inside "
"\\f[B]--config-file\\f[R] are not loaded before defaults are calculated.  "
"Frontend defaults may differ from values in the full \\f[B]build.conf\\f[R] "
"template.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Trixie-basierte \\f[B]i386\\f[R]- und \\f[B]i386-pae\\f[R]-Werte wählen den "
"MiniOS-Anbieter, wenn Distribution und Architektur dem Frontend über "
"Optionen oder die Umgebung übergeben werden. Werte, die nur in \\f[B]--"
"config-file\\f[R] gesetzt sind, werden vor der Berechnung der Standards "
"nicht geladen. Frontend-Standards können von den Werten in der vollständigen "
"\\f[B]build.conf\\f[R]-Vorlage abweichen.\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:157
msgid "Build a standard Bookworm Xfce image with frontend defaults:"
msgstr "Ein Standard-Bookworm-Xfce-Abbild mit Frontend-Standards bauen:"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:160
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo minios-cmd -d bookworm -a amd64 -de xfce -pv standard\n"
msgstr "sudo minios-cmd -d bookworm -a amd64 -de xfce -pv standard\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:163
msgid "Build with a MiniOS kernel, DKMS drivers, and retained locales:"
msgstr ""
"Bauen mit einem MiniOS-Kernel, DKMS-Treibern und beibehaltenen Locales:"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:166
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo minios-cmd -d bookworm -a amd64 -de xfce -pv toolbox -mk -dkms -kl\n"
msgstr "sudo minios-cmd -d bookworm -a amd64 -de xfce -pv toolbox -mk -dkms -kl\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:169
msgid "Build a multilingual image:"
msgstr "Erstellen Sie ein mehrsprachiges Abbild:"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:172
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo minios-cmd -d trixie -a amd64 -de xfce -pv standard -ml\n"
msgstr "sudo minios-cmd -d trixie -a amd64 -de xfce -pv standard -ml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:175
msgid "Build the Flux minimum variant with livekit:"
msgstr "Bauen Sie die minimale Flux-Variante mit livekit:"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:178
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo minios-cmd -d bookworm -a amd64 -de flux -pv minimum -ib livekit\n"
msgstr "sudo minios-cmd -d bookworm -a amd64 -de flux -pv minimum -ib livekit\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:181
msgid "Generate or overwrite a configuration file:"
msgstr "Eine Konfigurationsdatei erzeugen oder überschreiben:"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:185
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo minios-cmd --config-only --config-file ./myconfig.conf \\[rs]\n"
"  -d bookworm -a amd64 -de xfce -pv standard\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo minios-cmd --config-only --config-file ./myconfig.conf \\[rs]\n"
"  -d bookworm -a amd64 -de xfce -pv standard\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:188
msgid "Use the file without frontend merging:"
msgstr "Die Datei ohne Frontend-Zusammenführung verwenden:"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:191
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo BUILD_CONF=/absolute/path/myconfig.conf minios-live -\n"
msgstr "sudo BUILD_CONF=/absolute/path/myconfig.conf minios-live -\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-cmd.1:195
msgid ""
"\\f[B]minios-live\\f[R](1), \\f[B]condinapt\\f[R](1), \\f[B]condinapt-"
"minios\\f[R](7)\\fR"
msgstr ""
"\\f[B]minios-live\\f[R](1), \\f[B]condinapt\\f[R](1), \\f[B]condinapt-"
"minios\\f[R](7)\\fR"
